  "label": "Spaghetti as a Symbol of Domesticity and Comfort",
  "description": "The image of feeding spaghetti is a culturally recognized symbol of domestic comfort and nurturing care, often associated with maternal figures. This reinforces the meme's infantilizing message by linking political protest to a domestic, comforting, and childlike activity.",
